<urn:atm:triage:finding/AI38-QA1-HERMES-ADAPTER-CONTRACT>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AI38-QA1-HERMES-ADAPTER-CONTRACT" ;
  triage:title "Hermes adapter contract documentation inaccurate - gateway shim not imported in tests" ;
  triage:description "docs/plans/phase-ai/hermes-graft-adapter-contract.md claims that test_hermes_adapter.py and test_hermes_bridge.py import the checked-in, dependency-free Hermes gateway contract shim at crates/atm-graft-python/tests/hermes_gateway_shim so the adapter contract is actually exercised in CI. Grep confirms neither test file imports anything from that shim package. The AI.38 Protocol-injection adapter design has no dependency on Hermes' gateway.platforms.base classes at all, making the shim orphaned and the doc's CI-coverage claim false." ;
